creature VendingMachine
  traits
    cola_stock is a number
    chips_stock is a number
    coins is a number
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait cola_stock to 5
    give self the trait chips_stock to 5
    give self the trait coins to 0
  end born

  action insert_coin
    give self the trait coins to self coins + 1
    say "Coin inserted. Total coins: " + self coins
  end action

  action buy_cola
    when self coins > 1
      when self cola_stock > 0
        give self the trait coins to self coins - 2
        give self the trait cola_stock to self cola_stock - 1
        say "Vending Machine dispenses a Cola! Remaining stock: " + self cola_stock
      otherwise
        say "Out of Cola!"
      end when
    otherwise
      say "Not enough coins for Cola! Need 2 coins."
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring Machine to life as VendingMachine
Machine does insert_coin
Machine does buy_cola
Machine does insert_coin
Machine does buy_cola
